                    <i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i> How to get the link:
                </p>
                <ol style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; color: #1e40af;">
                    <li>Open Google Maps</li>
                    <li>Find the location</li>
                    <li>Tap "Share" → Copy link</li>
